	<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">WORLD STUDIO</span><h1>{view === 'create' ? 'Shape the next fragment' : view === 'library' ? 'Your kept fragments' : 'Your worlds'}</h1></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Toggle color theme" onclick={() => (theme = theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark')}>{theme === 'dark' ? '☼' : '☾'}</button><button class="outline" onclick={() => { authenticated=false; }}>Sign out</button><button class="primary" onclick={() => (view = 'create')}>New world <span>↗</span></button></div></header>
	{#if view === 'overview'}<section class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-card glass"><div class="orb"></div><span class="eyebrow warm">THE KEEP / ACTIVE WORLD</span><h2>Stories are easier<br /><em>to keep</em> than to start.</h2><p>Fantasy Arsenal turns one idea into a living place: characters with history, scenes with consequences, and artifacts you can find again.</p><button class="primary large" onclick={() => (view = 'create')}>Enter the world <span>→</span></button><div class="hero-foot"><span>LAST TOUCHED</span><strong>Today, 14:08</strong><span>ASSETS KEPT</span><strong>08</strong></div></div><div class="world-card glass"><div class="world-art"><div class="moon"></div><div class="mountain m1"></div><div class="mountain m2"></div><span>saltglass<br />marsh</span></div><div class="world-meta"><div><span class="eyebrow">WORLD 01</span><h3>{worldName}</h3><p>{genre} · quiet magic</p></div><button class="round" aria-label="Open world" onclick={() => (view = 'create')}>↗</button></div></div></section><section class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">CONTINUE THE THREAD</span><h2>Recent fragments</h2></div><button class="text-button" onclick={() => (view = 'library')}>View library →</button></section><section class="fragment-grid">{#each [{tag:'SCENE',title:'The map remembers her name',when:'Saved 42 minutes ago',class:'ink',mark:'01',name:'Under the white tide'},{tag:'SONG',title:'A hymn for unmoored things',when:'Saved yesterday',class:'rose',mark:'♫',name:'Salt in the lanternlight'},{tag:'CHARACTER',title:'The cartographer',when:'Saved 2 days ago',class:'mint',mark:'◌',name:'Lamo Hel'}] as item}<article class="fragment glass"><div class={`thumb ${item.class}`}><span>{item.mark}</span><b>{item.name}</b></div><div class="fragment-copy"><span class="tag">{item.tag}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.when}</p></div><button class="dots" aria-label="More options">•••</button></article>{/each}</section>
	{:else if view === 'create'}<section class="create-layout"><div class="composer glass"><div class="composer-head"><div><span class="eyebrow warm">NEW FRAGMENT</span><h2>Give it a spark.</h2></div><span class="status"><i></i>{status}</span></div><label for="world">World</label><div class="select-row"><select id="world" bind:value={worldName}><option>The Saltglass Atlas</option><option>Lamo Hel</option></select><input aria-label="Genre" bind:value={genre} /></div><label for="prompt">Your idea</label><textarea id="prompt" bind:value={prompt} rows="7"></textarea><div class="hint">Write naturally. We will clarify the idea first, then use that rewrite for the selected output.</div><button class="primary large full" onclick={begin}>Rewrite my idea <span>→</span></button></div><div class="result-panel"><div class="result-head"><span class="eyebrow">01 / CLARITY PASS</span><span class="locked">Private until you keep it</span></div>{#if rewrite}<div class="rewrite glass"><span class="eyebrow warm">REWRITE READY</span><p>{rewrite}</p><button class="text-button" onclick={() => (rewrite = '')}>Edit source</button></div>{:else}<div class="empty glass"><div class="spark">✦</div><h3>Your rewrite will appear here</h3><p>Nothing is generated until you choose to continue.</p></div>{/if}<div class="output-picker"><span class="eyebrow">THEN MAKE</span><div class="output-grid">{#each outputs as item}<button class:selected={output === item.id} onclick={() => (output = item.id)}><b>{item.icon}</b><strong>{item.label}</strong><small>{item.note}</small></button>{/each}</div></div><button class="primary full" disabled={!rewrite} onclick={generate}>Generate {outputs.find((item) => item.id === output)?.label.toLowerCase()} <span>↗</span></button></div></section>
	{:else}<section class="library glass"><span class="eyebrow">NO WORLD YET</span><h2>Every world starts empty.</h2><p>Create a world to keep approved characters, places, songs, images, and scenes together.</p><button class="primary" onclick={() => (view = 'create')}>Create your first world <span>→</span></button></section>{/if}<footer><span>FANTASY ARSENAL / A KEEP FOR IMAGINATION</span><span>Generation happens after your rewrite is clear.</span></footer></main></div>
{/if}
